a hotpot or spicy. Since no bakery can be spicy (point 1), dried Thai chilies, if they were a bakery, would have to be a hotpot. But hotpots are spicy (point 3), which contradicts the fact that no bakery can be spicy.\n\nTherefore, dried Thai chilies cannot be a bakery (and thus cannot be a cupcake or a product of Baked by Melissa) because it would lead to a contradiction.\n\nSo, the statement "Dried Thai chilies are not a product of Baked by Melissa" is **true**. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
