e do not have any information that directly links Max\'s designs to being dreamy.\n- We also do not have information that states all of Max\'s designs are timeless or that they are not timeless.\n\nGiven this, we cannot definitively conclude that a design by Max is dreamy based on the provided information. Therefore, the statement "A design by Max is evocative and dreamy" is uncertain. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
