ther must lose.\n\n8. **If a superhero movie is named after a character, that character appears in the movie.**.\n   - This confirms that Sir Digby appears in the movie.\n\nNow, let\'s apply this information to the statement: "Sir Digby’s nemesis loses.".\n\n- Since Sir Digby is a good guy (point 5 and 6) and good guys always win in superhero movies (point 1), Sir Digby must win.\n- If Sir Digby wins, his nemesis must lose (point 7).\n\nTherefore, the statement "Sir Digby’s nemesis loses" is true. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
