om point 5, we know that the training of the state-of-the-art text summarization model requires labeled data.\n\nSince unsupervised learning does not require labeled data, and the training of the state-of-the-art text summarization model requires labeled data, it follows that unsupervised learning cannot be the method used to train the state-of-the-art text summarization model.\n\nTherefore, the statement "Unsupervised learning is used to train the state-of-the-art text summarization model" is false. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
