 it, and consequently, she would have downloaded it.\n- Since Karen did not download "Black Mirror", it follows that "Black Mirror" cannot be popular.\n\nThus, the statement "Black Mirror" is popular is false.\n\nThe correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
